<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include ('partials/header') %>
    <main>
        <div class="card">
            <h1>About us</h1>
            <p>Our company focuses on Customer Service over anything else while offering efficient IT Support from lots of expert people around the world.</p>
        </div>
        <hr>
        <div class="card-rail">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mission</h3>
                <p>To provide fast, reliable IT support and help customers solve technical problems.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Vision</h3>
                <p>To become a trusted IT company known for excellent service and cybersecurity.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Target customers</h3>
            <p> Students, families, individuals, and businesses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Customer Service</h3>
            <p>We provide polite, professional, and friendly customer support. We listen carefully, understand problems, and offer clear solutions.</p>
            <h5>Rules:</h5>
            <ul>
                <li>Be polite and respectful.</li>
                <li>Listen carefully to customers.</li>
                <li>Ask questions about the problem.</li>
                <li>Explain solutions clearly.</li>
                <li>Thank customers for their patience.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <p>Supported and developed by Angel Torres & Kevin Barth</p>

    </main>
    <%- include ('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>